{
  "_doc": "Sentiment run registry (separate from configs/runs.json). A run (SR<NN>) is one fixed setup: data and training settings. Each model tried under it is a member SR<NN>-<model>. 'members' maps a result folder under results/sentiment/runs/ (with _seed<N> removed) to its run and model tag. src.sentiment.summarize_runs groups the score tables by this file.",
  "runs": {
    "SR01": "Real only (condition 1), S1 (ArSarcasm-v2), every roster classifier; BERTs 3 seeds, LLMs seed 42 first (SD-003)",
    "SR02": "Real + SG01 (open, zero-shot synthetic; condition 2): S1 train + 6,000 tweets (500 per variety x sentiment cell) from one SG01 generator; BERTs 3 seeds; Jais-2 (QLoRA, SR01 recipe) 3 seeds. Member = <classifier>_<generator>. The Jais-2 set could not fill its cells and was not trained.",
    "SR03": "Real only, NEU dropped: S1 train/dev/test without NEU tweets (6,069 / 675 / 2,252), 2-class NEG/POS head, every roster classifier, 3 seeds (SD-007). Macro F1 is over NEG/POS, not comparable with SR01/SR02.",
    "SR04": "Real + SG02 (open, few-shot k=5 synthetic; condition 2): S1 train + 6,000 tweets (500 per variety x sentiment cell) from one SG02 generator (Fanar, Qwen3, Aya); the 7 BERTs, 3 seeds, SR02 recipe (D-020). Member = <classifier>_<generator>.",
    "SR05": "Real + SG03 (targeted minimal pairs for the SR02 dev hard-case types, D-021; condition 3): S1 train + 4,000 texts (2,000 complete pairs) from one SG03 generator; 7 BERTs, 3 seeds, SR04 recipe. Member = <classifier>_<generator>.",
    "SR06": "Real + SG03-random (size-matched untargeted minimal pairs, the control for SR05, D-021): S1 train + 4,000 texts from one SG03-random generator; 7 BERTs, 3 seeds, SR04 recipe. Member = <classifier>_<generator>."
  },
